{
  "_readme": "Fireside guardrail rules as data. V1-V16 wording is verbatim from the fireside design spec (invariants table); V17 is drafted from amendment WA8 and needs human correction. Every record starts ratified:false; a human ratifies by adding their handle to approvals and setting ratified:true. Loosening a rule needs two distinct human approvals plus a clean probe run recorded in history; tightening needs one. scripts/check-fireside-governance.mjs enforces this against the base branch.",
